#: ces_offerswants/ces_offerswants.module:1147
msgid ""
"Note: If enabled, the system checks these email alerts every time cron is "
"run, usually once every 24h (ask for exact frequency to your site admin). "
"All users can enable/disable these alerts in their profiles, once exchange "
"administrator enables it here. Email templates can be personalized in "
"Administration > Templates."
msgstr ""

#: ces_offerswants/ces_offerswants.module:1151
msgid "Expired offer or want alert."
msgstr "Avviso di offerta o necessità scaduta."

#: ces_offerswants/ces_offerswants.module:1156
msgid "Enable expired alert."
msgstr "Abilita alert scaduto."

#: ces_offerswants/ces_offerswants.module:1158
msgid ""
"The system will check for last expired offers and wants, and will send an "
"email to the user owner.  If no offer or want is expired since last time "
"cron run, no email is sent. By default, this is enabled for all exchange "
"users."
msgstr ""

#: ces_offerswants/ces_offerswants.module1162;2493
msgid "New offer alert."
msgstr "Nuovo avviso offerta."

#: ces_offerswants/ces_offerswants.module:1167
msgid "Enable new offer alert."
msgstr "Abilita nuovo avviso offerta."

#: ces_offerswants/ces_offerswants.module:1169
msgid ""
"The system will check for last created offers, and will send an email to all"
" users of the exchange. If no offer is created since last time cron run, no "
"email is sent. By default, this is disabled for all exchange users, but they"
" can enable it in their profiles."
msgstr ""

#: ces_offerswants/ces_offerswants.module1173;2502
msgid "New want alert."
msgstr "Nuovo avviso necessità."

#: ces_offerswants/ces_offerswants.module:1178
msgid "Enable new want alert."
msgstr "Abilita nuovo avviso necessità"

#: ces_offerswants/ces_offerswants.module:1180
msgid ""
"The system will check for last created wants, and will send an email to all "
"users of the exchange. If no want is created since last time cron run, no "
"email is sent. By default, this is disabled for all exchange users, but they"
" can enable it in their profiles."
msgstr ""

#: ces_offerswants/ces_offerswants.module1184;2511
msgid "Offers periodical alert."
msgstr "Avviso periodico sulle offerte."

#: ces_offerswants/ces_offerswants.module:1189
