"With the frequency you select, the system will send an email to all users of"
" the exchange with a list of last updated offers. When you enable this email"
" alert, the first mailing will be done today (next time cron runs), the "
"second will be in the period of time you selected, and so on. By default, "
"this is disabled for all exchange users, but they can enable it in their "
"profiles."
msgstr ""

